OL,3,GNEWSABishop is handed disciplinary
OL,4,Acomplaint
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Bishop of Salisbury has had a
OL,7,Fdisciplinary complaint brought against
OL,8,Fhim following an investigation into
OL,9,Ffinancial irregularities.
OL,11,FThe Rt Revd Stephen Lake was handed the
OL,12,Fcomplaint following a Church of England
OL,13,Finvestigation.
OL,15,FLake, 62, who was appointed Bishop of
OL,16,FSalisbury in 2022 and stepped down
OL,17,Fvoluntarily in April, is also facing a
OL,18,Fseparate disciplinary complaint over
OL,19,Fsafeguarding concerns that do not
OL,20,Frelate to children.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
